{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be64794-db0e-11ef-8199-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be40278-db0e-11ef-b78c-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8be4027a-db0e-11ef-a422-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉文公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋文公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be4027b-db0e-11ef-afe2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"悼公","people_name_jianti_auto":"悼公","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8be4027c-db0e-11ef-a6c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楚莊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚庄王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8be4027d-db0e-11ef-96ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳夫差","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴夫差","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8be4027e-db0e-11ef-98a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂齊桓公、晉文公至悼公以及楚莊王、吳夫差之類。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓齐桓公、晋文公至悼公以及楚庄王、吴夫差之类。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8be40279-db0e-11ef-bf1a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8be40280-db0e-11ef-9aad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8be40281-db0e-11ef-a8a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be40282-db0e-11ef-9561-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8be40283-db0e-11ef-bd35-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂晉六卿、魯三家、齊田氏之類。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓晋六卿、鲁三家、齐田氏之类。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8be4027f-db0e-11ef-a152-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"屬，聯屬也，音之欲翻。凡聯屬之屬皆同音。","note_content_jianti_auto":"属，联属也，音之欲翻。凡联属之属皆同音。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8be40285-db0e-11ef-86d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"太叔帶","people_name_jianti_auto":"太叔带","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be40287-db0e-11ef-bed2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄王","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄王","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8be40288-db0e-11ef-9668-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉文公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋文公","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8be40289-db0e-11ef-866e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太叔帶","people_name_jianti_auto":"太叔带","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8be4028a-db0e-11ef-9e20-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄王","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄王","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8be4028b-db0e-11ef-bdbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8be4028c-db0e-11ef-bdbe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"氾","place_name_jianti_auto":"泛","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8be4028d-db0e-11ef-bef9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郟","place_name_jianti_auto":"郏","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8be4028e-db0e-11ef-aafe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"太叔帶之難，襄王出居于氾。晉文公帥師納王，殺太叔帶。旣定襄王于郟，王勞之以地，辭；請隧焉，王弗許云云。杜預曰：闕地通路曰隧，此乃王者葬禮也。諸侯皆縣柩而下。王章者，章顯王者異於諸侯。古者天子謂同姓諸侯爲伯父、叔父。隧，音遂。惡，烏路翻。難，乃旦翻。氾，音汎。勞，力到翻。闕，其月翻。縣，音玄。柩，其久翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"太叔带之难，襄王出居于泛。晋文公帅师纳王，杀太叔带。既定襄王于郏，王劳之以地，辞；请隧焉，王弗许云云。杜预曰：阙地通路曰隧，此乃王者葬礼也。诸侯皆县柩而下。王章者，章显王者异于诸侯。古者天子谓同姓诸侯为伯父、叔父。隧，音遂。恶，乌路翻。难，乃旦翻。泛，音泛。劳，力到翻。阙，其月翻。县，音玄。柩，其久翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8be40286-db0e-11ef-a4be-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"曹","place_name_jianti_auto":"曹","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be40290-db0e-11ef-80a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滕","place_name_jianti_auto":"滕","place_note":"山東滕州","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8be40291-db0e-11ef-9f82-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邾","place_name_jianti_auto":"邾","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8be40292-db0e-11ef-8e1b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莒","place_name_jianti_auto":"莒","place_note":"山東莒縣","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8be40293-db0e-11ef-a27b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8be40294-db0e-11ef-b10d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"曹、滕、邾、莒，春秋時小國。莒，居許翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"曹、滕、邾、莒，春秋时小国。莒，居许翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"8be4028f-db0e-11ef-a79a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"季氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"季氏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8be40296-db0e-11ef-acbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季友","people_name_jianti_auto":"季友","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8be40297-db0e-11ef-9cb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季平子","people_name_jianti_auto":"季平子","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8be40298-db0e-11ef-911b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭公","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭公","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8be40299-db0e-11ef-a3a3-a0d36