:"司馬子期","people_name_jianti_auto":"司马子期","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"8be402aa-db0e-11ef-bdeb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"石乞","people_name_jianti_auto":"石乞","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"8be402ab-db0e-11ef-bc42-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"白公","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公","start_index":159,"tongjian_id":"8be402ac-db0e-11ef-8d34-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"智伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"智伯","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"8be402ad-db0e-11ef-8996-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉出公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋出公","start_index":201,"tongjian_id":"8be402ae-db0e-11ef-b66d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"出公","people_name_jianti_auto":"出公","start_index":205,"tongjian_id":"8be402af-db0e-11ef-ae46-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"智伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"智伯","start_index":210,"tongjian_id":"8be402b0-db0e-11ef-84cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"哀公","people_name_jianti_auto":"哀公","start_index":221,"tongjian_id":"8be402b1-db0e-11ef-8477-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be402b2-db0e-11ef-a17a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯國","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁国","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8be402b3-db0e-11ef-8c7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊國","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐国","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8be402b4-db0e-11ef-8758-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","place_note":"都郢都，湖北江陵","start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"8be402b5-db0e-11ef-bad5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":178,"tongjian_id":"8be402b6-db0e-11ef-af16-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":193,"tongjian_id":"8be402b7-db0e-11ef-bdcd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"8be402b8-db0e-11ef-afd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魯大夫季氏，自季友以來，世執魯國之政。季平子逐昭公，季康子逐哀公，然終身北面，不敢篡國。田常，卽陳恆。田氏本陳氏；溫公避國諱，改「恆」曰「常」。陳成子得齊國之政，殺闞止，弑簡公，而亦不敢自立。史記·世家以陳敬仲完爲田敬仲完，陳成子恆爲田常，故通鑑因以爲據。白公勝殺楚令尹子西、司馬子期，石乞曰：「焚庫弑王，不然不濟！」白公曰：「弑王不祥，焚庫無聚。」智伯當晉之衰，專其國政，侵伐鄰國，於晉大夫爲最強；攻晉出公，出公道死。智伯欲幷晉而不敢，乃奉哀公驕立之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲁大夫季氏，自季友以来，世执鲁国之政。季平子逐昭公，季康子逐哀公，然终身北面，不敢篡国。田常，即陈恒。田氏本陈氏；温公避国讳，改「恒」曰「常」。陈成子得齐国之政，杀阚止，弑简公，而亦不敢自立。史记·世家以陈敬仲完为田敬仲完，陈成子恒为田常，故通鉴因以为据。白公胜杀楚令尹子西、司马子期，石乞曰：「焚库弑王，不然不济！」白公曰：「弑王不祥，焚库无聚。」智伯当晋之衰，专其国政，侵伐邻国，于晋大夫为最强；攻晋出公，出公道死。智伯欲幷晋而不敢，乃奉哀公骄立之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":240,"tongjian_id":"8be40295-db0e-11ef-9fda-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"定王","people_name_jianti_auto":"定王","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8be402be-db0e-11ef-ad6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"智伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"智伯","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8be402bf-db0e-11ef-931a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8be402c0-db0e-11ef-aa32-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8be402c1-db0e-11ef-939c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8be402c2-db0e-11ef-a344-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉國","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋国","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8be402c3-db0e-11ef-b76b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記·六國年表：定王十六年，趙、魏、韓滅智伯，遂三分晉國。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记·六国年表：定王十六年，赵、魏、韩灭智伯，遂三分晋国。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":297,"tongjian_id":"8be402bd-db0e-11ef-8009-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陸德明","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆德明","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be402c6-db0e-11ef-b0da-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陸德明經典釋文：凡復字，其義訓又者，並音扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"陆德明经典释文：凡复字，其义训又者，并音扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":331,"tongjian_id":"8be402c5-db0e-11ef-b254-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-479,"link_td_description":"白公胜，芈姓，熊氏，名胜，春秋末期楚国大夫，太子建之子，楚平王的孙子，早年因故流奔外国。回楚后，被封于白地（今河南息县东），号白公。后发动“白公之乱”，劫楚惠王，被沈诸梁打败，自缢而死。","link_td_id":"Q10009097","link_td_number_id":521682,"people_name":"白公","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公","people_xingming":"白公胜","start_index":228,"tongjian_id":"8be64794-db0e-11ef-8199-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"迨后赵有晋阳，犹足拒塞秦人，为七国雄。秦庄襄王二年，蒙骜...","context_before":"...控带山河，踞天下之肩背，为河东之根本，诚古今必争之地也。","source_end_index":59,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"192e46c4-d698-5aa2-af71-576441d161eb","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"周封叔虞于此，其国日以盛强，狎主齐盟，藩屏周室者，几二百年。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《水经注》欑茅，本一城也。或以为欑城在此地。旁有吴泽，亦...","context_before":"...后汉志》又有蔡城，盖蔡叔之采邑。○欑城，在县西北二十里。","source_end_index":78,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"28fcadbb-53f7-5e4e-bafe-eb03eb2308cc","source_start_index":65,"source_text":"周襄王赐晋文公欑、茅之田。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"嗚呼！幽、厲失德，周道日衰，綱紀散壞，下陵上替，諸侯專征，大夫擅政，禮之大體什喪七八矣，然文、武之祀猶緜緜相屬者，蓋以周之子孫尚能守其名分故也。何以言之？昔晉文公有大功於王室，請隧於襄王，襄王不許，曰：「王章也。未有代德而有二王，亦叔父之所惡也。不然，叔父有地而隧，又何請焉！」文公於是懼而不敢違。是故以周之地則不大於曹、滕，以周之民則不衆於邾、莒，然歷數百年，宗主天下，雖以晉、楚、齊、秦之強不敢加者，何哉？徒以名分尚存故也。至於季氏之於魯，田常之於齊，白公之於楚，智伯之於晉，其勢皆足以逐君而自爲，然而卒不敢者，豈其力不足而心不忍哉，乃畏奸名犯分而天下共誅之也。今晉大夫暴蔑其君，剖分晉國，天子旣不能討，又寵秩之，使列於諸侯，是區區之名分復不能守而幷棄之也。先王之禮於斯盡矣！","content_fanyi":"唉！周幽王、周厉王丧失为君之德，周朝的治国之道日渐衰微，纲纪散乱毁坏，在下者侵凌在上者，在上者政令不行，诸侯擅自征伐，大夫把持国政，礼制的大体已丧失了十分之七八。然而周文王、周武王的祭祀仍能绵绵接续，这大概是因为周室子孙还能守住名分的缘故。为什么这样说呢？从前晋文公对周王室立有大功，向周襄王请求死后使用隧葬之礼，周襄王不答应，说：“这是天子的礼制。没有取代周室的德行，却要有两个天子，这也是叔父所厌恶的。如果不是这样，叔父有自己的封地，完全可以自行隧葬，又何必来向我请求呢！”晋文公因此畏惧，不敢违背。所以，周室的土地并不比曹国、滕国大，民众并不比邾国、莒国多，然而历经数百年，始终是天下宗主，即使以晋、楚、齐、秦的强大，也不敢侵犯，这是为什么呢？只不过因为名分还存在而已。至于鲁国的季氏、齐国的田常、楚国的白公胜、晋国的智伯，他们的势力都足够驱逐国君而自行即位，可是终究不敢这样做，难道是力量不足或于心不忍吗？不过是畏惧背上奸犯名分的罪名而遭到天下人共同讨伐罢了。如今晋国大夫欺凌蔑视自己的国君，瓜分晋国，天子已经无法讨伐，反又封赏他们，使他们列于诸侯，这样，周室仅存的一点名分也不能守住，而一并丢弃了。先王的礼制到这里就完全终结了！","content_jianti_auto":"呜呼！幽、厉失德，周道日衰，纲纪散坏，下陵上替，诸侯专征，大夫擅政，礼之大体什丧七八矣，然文、武之祀犹緜緜相属者，盖以周之子孙尚能守其名分故也。何以言之？昔晋文公有大功于王室，请隧于襄王，襄王不许，曰：「王章也。未有代德而有二王，亦叔父之所恶也。不然，叔父有地而隧，又何请焉！」文公于是惧而不敢违。是故以周之地则不大于曹、滕，以周之民则不众于邾、莒，然历数百年，宗主天下，虽以晋、楚、齐、秦之强不敢加者，何哉？徒以名分尚存故也。至于季氏之于鲁，田常之于齐，白公之于楚，智伯之于晋，其势皆足以逐君而自为，然而卒不敢者，岂其力不足而心不忍哉，乃畏奸名犯分而天下共诛之也。今晋大夫暴蔑其君，剖分晋国，天子既不能讨，又宠秩之，使列于诸侯，是区区之名分复不能守而幷弃之也。先王之礼于斯尽矣！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be40278-db0e-11ef-b78c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8be40278-db0e-11ef-b78c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復言，謂言必信而可復也。重諾，重然諾也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复言，谓言必信而可复也。重诺，重然诺也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa29-db0e-11ef-a4db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"白公勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公胜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa2b-db0e-11ef-a9f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"白公勝欲報其父讎，不勝其忿，以及其叔父，事見左傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"白公胜欲报其父雠，不胜其忿，以及其叔父，事见左传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa2a-db0e-11ef-a038-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-479,"link_td_description":"白公胜，芈姓，熊氏，名胜，春秋末期楚国大夫，太子建之子，楚平王的孙子，早年因故流奔外国。回楚后，被封于白地（今河南息县东），号白公。后发动“白公之乱”，劫楚惠王，被沈诸梁打败，自缢而死。","link_td_id":"Q10009097","link_td_number_id":521682,"people_name":"白公勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公胜","people_xingming":"白公胜","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc4-db0e-11ef-8ff3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"夫其膝行、蒲伏，非恭也；復言、重諾，非信也；糜金、散玉，非惠也；刎首、決腹，非勇也。要之，謀不遠而動不義，其楚白公勝之流乎！","content_fanyi":"跪着用膝盖前行，伏地爬行，并不是真正的恭敬；言出必行、看重承诺，并不是真正的守信；过度耗费金钱、散发珠玉，并不是真正的恩惠；自割脖颈、自剖腹部，并不是真正的勇敢。总之，谋虑不长远而行动不合道义，恐怕就是楚国那个为复仇而死的白公胜之流吧！","content_jianti_auto":"夫其膝行、蒲伏，非恭也；复言、重诺，非信也；糜金、散玉，非惠也；刎首、决腹，非勇也。要之，谋不远而动不义，其楚白公胜之流乎！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":542,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第七 (秦紀二) / 始皇帝下 / 二十五年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8d6636d3-db0e-11ef-b0ab-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-222},"tongjian_id":"8d6636d3-db0e-11ef-b0ab-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":3,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"淮南厲王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南厉王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d739-db0e-11ef-8f90-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"長","people_name_jianti_auto":"长","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73a-db0e-11ef-b0f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安","people_name_jianti_auto":"安","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73b-db0e-11ef-ac01-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"阜陵侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"阜陵侯","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73c-db0e-11ef-9bef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勃","people_name_jianti_auto":"勃","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73d-db0e-11ef-8e5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安陽侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"安阳侯","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73e-db0e-11ef-80e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賜","people_name_jianti_auto":"赐","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d73f-db0e-11ef-8b6c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陽周侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"阳周侯","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d740-db0e-11ef-a34e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"良","people_name_jianti_auto":"良","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d741-db0e-11ef-bb73-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"東城侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"东城侯","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d742-db0e-11ef-966e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"淮南厲王長子安封阜陵侯，勃封安陽侯，賜封陽周侯，良封東城侯。","note_content_jianti_auto":"淮南厉王长子安封阜陵侯，勃封安阳侯，赐封阳周侯，良封东城侯。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d738-db0e-11ef-83dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d746-db0e-11ef-8e06-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"淮南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d747-db0e-11ef-9764-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d748-db0e-11ef-b86f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言若尊王其子，則是淮南王無罪，漢枉殺之也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言若尊王其子，则是淮南王无罪，汉枉杀之也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d745-db0e-11ef-aede-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d74a-db0e-11ef-b026-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：少壯，猶言稍長大。少，詩沼翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：少壮，犹言稍长大。少，诗沼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d749-db0e-11ef-9f29-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"白公勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公胜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d74d-db0e-11ef-a758-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楚平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚平王","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d74e-db0e-11ef-ab9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"建","people_name_jianti_auto":"建","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d74f-db0e-11ef-8ef6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"建","people_name_jianti_auto":"建","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d750-db0e-11ef-9446-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"平王","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d751-db0e-11ef-a548-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d752-db0e-11ef-8f8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子胥","people_name_jianti_auto":"子胥","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d753-db0e-11ef-9ed0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d754-db0e-11ef-aa64-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子西","people_name_jianti_auto":"子西","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d755-db0e-11ef-9441-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子期","people_name_jianti_auto":"子期","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d756-db0e-11ef-9b73-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d757-db0e-11ef-9db1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d758-db0e-11ef-b117-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d759-db0e-11ef-b325-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75a-db0e-11ef-8b8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75b-db0e-11ef-b09b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郢","place_name_jianti_auto":"郢","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75c-db0e-11ef-a26f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75d-db0e-11ef-814b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"白公勝，楚平王之孫，太子建之子。建得罪於平王，出奔而死於鄭，勝又奔吳；子胥以吳師入郢，勝蓋預焉，是讎其大父也。及其還楚，殺子西、子期，是讎其叔父也。剡，式冉翻；利也。靡，武彼翻；師古曰：言與讎人俱斃。康曰：武皮切，碎也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"白公胜，楚平王之孙，太子建之子。建得罪于平王，出奔而死于郑，胜又奔吴；子胥以吴师入郢，胜盖预焉，是雠其大父也。及其还楚，杀子西、子期，是雠其叔父也。剡，式冉翻；利也。靡，武彼翻；师古曰：言与雠人俱毙。康曰：武皮切，碎也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d74c-db0e-11ef-b713-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":10,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見十二卷高祖十一年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e78f560-db0e-11ef-8fac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75f-db0e-11ef-b5d6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見十二卷高祖十一年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见十二卷高祖十一年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d75e-db0e-11ef-b2c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古"